@startuml budget-exchange-publish
' The replica side of the budget counter exchange: seed, count, publish, fold.
' Cadences, key kinds, and the enforcement rule are the prose on
' docs/src/gateways/llm/budgets-and-rate-limits.md (the source of truth).
!include _style.puml

participant "Gateway\nreplica-0" as r0 #90EE90
participant "Gateway\nreplica-1" as r1 #90EE90
participant "kaalm-budget-{provider}\nConfigMap" as cm #FFD580

== Startup ==
r0 -> cm : read _canonical
cm --> r0 : seed the counter

== Every LLM call ==
r0 -> r0 : increment the\nin-memory counter

== Every 10s ==
r0 -> cm : SSA own key
r1 -> cm : SSA own key

== Every ConfigMap watch event ==
cm --> r0 : changed
r0 -> r0 : fold peer partials\nplus _retired
@enduml
